s from 1951 to 2025, 75 years, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids February to March came in under 90% of normal in 37 of them. In 2025 June to July hit 200% of normal on the middle, while November to December fell to 40%. So far in 2026 January to February sits at 23% on the middle. Grid 26829 had its driest year in 2012 at 51% of normal.</p>"}
